      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process**, immediately before that process starts. \n\nSpecifically, the page describes:\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the **child process environment** (for both the Ingest and Query agent processes)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential simply by reading its own environment variables, since the key only exists inside the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API.",
